 "description": "Default visual presentation for a focused property or room discussion when photos help, UI is supported and text-only was not requested. Render once; reuse the same returned room identity for explicit retries. Read only: show a PROPERTY-only or ROOM-only gallery of actual published photos. Default ROOM when roomId/roomQuery is supplied, PROPERTY otherwise. A room never includes property photos. Use exact room IDs from availability or a unique room name; no substitutions. Pages contain at most12 photos. No dates required. get_photo_gallery is data-only for in-card pagination; show_property_photos intentionally renders once.",
